<blockquote class="uncited"><div>I wonder if anyone has noticed this strange behavior on the RD-5R:<br><br>Output Power: <br>in DMR you can't set it freely. When you scroll the power the values don't go in sequence, they jump, for example, from 1W to 4W to 2W. Also, going one step beyond 5W you get null&gt;25.<br><br>Color Code: <br>although the color code is set to 1 in the codeplug, it shows a different code, usually 3. So when it receives a signal it takes some time to set it to the correct code.<br><br>Firmware Version: 20250223 but I have seen this behavior on previous versions too.<br><br>Note: I have same settings, same version and same codeplug installed on DM1801 without problems</div></blockquote>When you change the power from Channels/VFO screens, or in the Channel details ?<br><br>I just tried on my RD-5R, and I'm unable to reproduce.<br><br>Could you, <strong class="text-strong">read the codeplug from your RD-5R</strong> and post it here (or email it me).<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Fri Mar 07, 2025 3:44 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
